                          "content": "Biography",
                          "fontFamily": "Bricolage Grotesque",
                          "fontSize": 16,
                          "fontWeight": "700"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "zpcTn",
                          "name": "bioText",
                          "content": "James worked as a carpenter for over 40 years, building homes across the Portland area. He was known for his meticulous craftsmanship and dedication to his family. A veteran of the Korean War, he served with distinction before returning home to start his family.\n\nHe married Mary in 1968 and they raised their son David together in a small home that James built himself in 1972.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.6,
                          "fontFamily": "DM Sans",
                          "fontSize": 14,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
